    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT DAWN OF SHADOW</h2><br>Evil lurks the realm! An ancient force is awakening from it's ashes. Dawn of Shadow set in a Low-Fantasy Medieval World.<br>Choose your path and dive into a tale of epic fantasy in this action RPG title!<br><br><strong>CREATE YOUR HERO</strong><br>Become a keeper of the peace, join order of the Knight Templars. Choose from a wide selection of character customization elements, or play as a pre-built character. Explore, build, loot, battle through the realm and beyond.<br><br><strong>AN ORIGINAL STORY</strong><br>You find yourself in a cataclysmic turn of events. Templar Order, once Realm's mightiest heroes, now turn evil, seek to dominate free peoples and anyone who oppose them. Seeking ancient knowledge, they plan to awaken Legions of Hell back from the Abyss.<br><br><strong>FAMILIAR YET UNIQUE</strong><br>As fans of aRPG, Hack and Slash, and Souls-like games. We tried our best to mix best parts of those genres.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/48de0b3e1ce56e428b140180d6c51716.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>Magic Schools</strong><br>Learn from different trainers or explore ancient knowledge to unlock hidden Magical abilities<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/2ff47f955b2fa1f6a847a7dc229c75b8.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>Items, Loot and Enchantments</strong><br>Hundreds of items and item enchantments that comes with a unique Rune system.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/afd571efe66e58e73c13a27d0e0b4995.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>Tactical Combat</strong><br>Tactical combat that offers wide range of weapons with unique playstyles, skills and combos!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/ce8b757e66daef4568e85b9f8d590677.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>Character Customization</strong><br>Create your own Hero, and customize even more as game progresses!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/b1092e23e05a1f704539260ae91642e8.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>Unique Boss Fights</strong><br>Each boss feels different! Adapt, follow patterns and slay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/afa1bac9cf3a6af840d1975fa2ae6ccd.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>Wide range of Enemies and Monsters</strong><br>Over hundred of different Mob types to battle from Wights to Humans, Orcs to Treants.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/f1ace748298ee9394af71b9e83b08e58.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>Quests &amp; Player Driven Story</strong><br>Follow the main storyline or create your own story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/7b4ba3bd1a0ccab5f7e256602b2c864e.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>A living world</strong><br>From towns to castles, dungeons to ruins. Dawn of Shadow offers wide variety of places to visit and explore.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT DAWN OF SHADOW</h2><br>Evil lurks the realm! An ancient force is awakening from it's ashes. Dawn of Shadow set in a Low-Fantasy Medieval World.<br>Choose your path and dive into a tale of epic fantasy in this action RPG title!<br><br><strong>CREATE YOUR HERO</strong><br>Become a keeper of the peace, join order of the Knight Templars. Choose from a wide selection of character customization elements, or play as a pre-built character. Explore, build, loot, battle through the realm and beyond.<br><br><strong>AN ORIGINAL STORY</strong><br>You find yourself in a cataclysmic turn of events. Templar Order, once Realm's mightiest heroes, now turn evil, seek to dominate free peoples and anyone who oppose them. Seeking ancient knowledge, they plan to awaken Legions of Hell back from the Abyss.<br><br><strong>FAMILIAR YET UNIQUE</strong><br>As fans of aRPG, Hack and Slash, and Souls-like games. We tried our best to mix best parts of those genres.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/48de0b3e1ce56e428b140180d6c51716.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>Magic Schools</strong><br>Learn from different trainers or explore ancient knowledge to unlock hidden Magical abilities<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/2ff47f955b2fa1f6a847a7dc229c75b8.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>Items, Loot and Enchantments</strong><br>Hundreds of items and item enchantments that comes with a unique Rune system.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/afd571efe66e58e73c13a27d0e0b4995.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>Tactical Combat</strong><br>Tactical combat that offers wide range of weapons with unique playstyles, skills and combos!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/ce8b757e66daef4568e85b9f8d590677.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>Character Customization</strong><br>Create your own Hero, and customize even more as game progresses!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/b1092e23e05a1f704539260ae91642e8.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>Unique Boss Fights</strong><br>Each boss feels different! Adapt, follow patterns and slay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/afa1bac9cf3a6af840d1975fa2ae6ccd.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>Wide range of Enemies and Monsters</strong><br>Over hundred of different Mob types to battle from Wights to Humans, Orcs to Treants.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/f1ace748298ee9394af71b9e83b08e58.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>Quests &amp; Player Driven Story</strong><br>Follow the main storyline or create your own story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244810/extras/7b4ba3bd1a0ccab5f7e256602b2c864e.webp?t=1733285890\" /></span> <strong>A living world</strong><br>From towns to castles, dungeons to ruins. Dawn of Shadow offers wide variety of places to visit and explore.",
